# Build environment for this app, sourced by tools/build-apps.sh.
#
# arduino-esp32's CMakeLists refuses to configure unless CONFIG_FREERTOS_HZ is
# 1000. espix runs 100 and the app is built to match, because the tick rate is
# compiled into pdMS_TO_TICKS on both sides and disagreeing would make every
# delay wrong by a factor of ten. This is the escape hatch the Arduino core
# provides for exactly that situation; see the note in main/neopixel.cpp about
# keeping delays to multiples of 10ms.
ARDUINO_SKIP_TICK_CHECK=1
